WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Feasible means possible to do in practice.. While listening, focus on keywords

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
rather than every single word.. Push your reading speed to two hundred words a

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
minute without pointing.. Record yourself and choose just one thing to fix..

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Give every paragraph one single job.. Dictation is the fastest way to improve

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
listening.. Shadowing: imitate the audio one second behind.. Read your word

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
cards aloud; your ear memorises too.. Write summaries: retell every text in

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
three sentences.. Listening with the transcript fixes pronunciation..
